y are expected to hear from  pope francis who has spoken out  frequently  on the need for the world to address  climate change tony  all right ed the history of zoom  meetings i hope it is a relatively short  history  all told and there are costs of course  to addressing climate change but we have  to remember there are costs of doing  nothing  as well ed thank you very much
 

